0..76 Comment "// An open play ridden along a flow whose target drops an offer: a play that"
77..151 Comment "// has not reached the offer rides, one that took the dropped branch is no"
152..225 Comment "// prefix of the target and is refused at that move, and a play held by a"
226..286 Comment "// variable, which may yet take it, is refused as narrowing."
